ex, cost rollup, finds count, and autonomous self-heals (`CLAUDE.md` Â§4).\n\n- **Status: deployed and self-running**, currently mid-\"revamp\" â€” recent commits (W1â€“W5) re-aim it from a raw collector toward an **agentic-AI awareness/decision instrument**, including a read-only Flask dashboard (`dashboard/`, port 5001) shipped 2026-06-11. Active branch: `foreman/aurora-revamp`.\n\nOne caveat worth flagging: the plan doc's own headline status (335 artifacts, MTD spend) is stamped from 2026-05-18/19 and reconciled multiple times â€” treat exact counts as point-in-time, not live."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8052,"cache_read_input_tokens":27995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8052},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3e5403d-da9f-4e88-817e-2103536b8c2e","uuid":"bb6a5e40-2627-47d4-b442-2faf4ff0ced5","request_id":"req_011Cc1HgkDCCgHrohcRJqVUd"}
